notes.body:
Do something like:
```
  if (plen == 0 || plen == 1 || plen == 2) {
    proto_tree_add_uint(git_tree, hf_git_packet_type, tvb, offset,
                        4, plen);
    return 4;
  }
```

Where packet_type is using a value_string array

```
static const value_string packet_type_vals[] = {
  { 0, "Flush" },
  { 1, "Delimiter" },
  { 2, "Response end" },
  { 0, NULL }
};
```

This way you can use filters like git.packet_type == 1 to find delimiter packets.

I will let you decide what is the best name for this generic field.

